     "Oof. Okay, so room number one would be me laughing and I call it the room of effervescent feeling, which would be just all the times that I was happy and laughing and witty and funny and comical and stupid jokes I've laughed at and things that have brought me humor and all the various things in that world that I've just give that sense of relief as to shit really is not that serious Room number two would be the people I've loved and more so the examples or the memories of me both feeling love and giving love, it's divided in half. It's me giving love's on one side and me receiving love's on the other side and it's every family member in love, and friend and connection and animal and tree and plant and everything.",
